    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "359225cfcfd5ae2b943d": "I am interested in mage training.",
        "89d39059ccd97bf14770": "Well met, $c.  You want some advice?  Befriend a mage!  We have a trick or two up our sleeves, we do...",
        "8db77b2d2ece2576d306": "Through rigorous retraining I have had to break many students of all they had previously learned so that I might teach them anew.  The service I offer becomes increasingly difficult to perform each time it is done.  It is for that reason that it becomes increasingly expensive with each retraining.  Do you desire that I break you of the talents you have learned?",
        "ddc63b0a57c58f6b5d3f": "Greetings.  I'm a gnome mage trainer, and you're a mage.",
        "e45fc80a6b967ab59a79": "I am interested in mage training."
      },
      "name": "Marryk Nurribit",
      "subName": "Mage Trainer",
